cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RustRunner in your work, please cite it as below, and cite the tools your pipeline ran."
type: software
title: "RustRunner: a visual, no-code workflow builder for bioinformatics"
abstract: >-
  RustRunner is a desktop application for building and running bioinformatics
  pipelines visually, without a workflow language or the command line. Pipelines
  are drawn as connected steps from templates and a catalog of tools that are
  installed in pinned conda environments and run by a Rust execution engine.
authors:
